flowchart TD
    Start([Start Application]) --> LoadData[Load Data from rentals_data.json]
    LoadData --> UI[Initialize GUI & Notebook Tabs]
    
    UI --> TabSelect{Select a Tab}

    %% Rentals Tab
    TabSelect -->|1. Rentals Tab| R_Catalog[Browse Catalog & Add Items]
    R_Catalog --> R_Cart[Cart Auto-Updates Totals]
    R_Cart --> R_Input[Enter Name & Dates]
    R_Input --> R_Checkout{Click Checkout}
    R_Checkout -->|Missing Info| R_Warn[Show Warning Box]
    R_Checkout -->|Valid| R_Process[Generate Receipt ID & Calculate Tax]
    R_Process --> R_Save[(Save to JSON)]
    R_Save --> R_Confirm[Show Confirmation & Clear Cart]

    %% Returns Tab
    TabSelect -->|2. Returns Tab| Ret_Search[Search by ID or Name/Date]
    Ret_Search --> Ret_Check{Match Found?}
    Ret_Check -->|No| Ret_Error[Show 'Not Found']
    Ret_Check -->|Yes| Ret_Display[Display Receipt Details]
    Ret_Display --> Ret_Process{Click Process Return}
    Ret_Process -->|Confirm| Ret_Delete[Delete Record from Memory]
    Ret_Delete --> Ret_Save[(Save to JSON)]
    Ret_Save --> Ret_Success[Show Success & Clear Display]

    %% Staff Tab
    TabSelect -->|3. Staff Access Tab| S_List[View All Active Rentals]
    S_List --> S_Select[Select a Record]
    S_Select --> S_View[View Record Breakdown]
    S_View --> S_Action{Choose Action}
    
    S_Action -->|Copy Record| S_Clipboard[Copy formatted text to Clipboard]
    
    S_Action -->|Delete Record| S_Confirm{Confirm Deletion?}
    S_Confirm -->|Yes| S_Delete[Delete Record from Memory]
    S_Delete --> S_Save[(Save to JSON)]
    S_Save --> S_Refresh[Refresh Staff List]